## English

This project was generated by `kmvpy create`. The Python project lives in the `__PY_PROJECT_NAME__/` directory.

### Quick Start

Open the generated outer workspace root in Cursor so the preset `.vscode/settings.json` and `.vscode/launch.json` remain available.

Activate a Conda environment and install the runtime dependencies (this project uses Conda only, not venv):

```bash
cd __PY_PROJECT_NAME__
conda activate kmvpy   # or any Conda environment with the project dependencies installed
python -m pip install -e ".[postgresql]"
```

Run `Python: Select Interpreter` in Cursor, select the interpreter of the activated Conda environment, and start the application:

```bash
cd __PY_PROJECT_NAME__
conda activate kmvpy
python app/run.py
```


